{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04373","headline":"晚憩南阳旅馆 · 刘希夷","name":"晚憩南阳旅馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅馆何年废，征夫此日过。\n途穷人自哭，春至鸟还歌。\n行路新知少，荒田古径多。\n池篁覆丹谷，坟树遶清波。\n日照蓬阴转，风微野气和。\n伤心不可去，回首怨如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}